WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.537
Vladimir Putin celebrating his army.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.540
The special guests this year, children

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.042
bused in from Ukraine's

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:11.044
occupied territories.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.980
Thank you Uncle Yuri for saving me,

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:14.781
my sister

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.916
and hundreds of thousands of children

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.651
in Mariupol.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.292
I forget too little.

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.928
Now, don't be shy.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.231
Go hug  Uncle Yuri.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.333
Did everyone give a hug?

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.369
Look, it's the man who saved you all.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.840
But who is Anya?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.475
By tracking down family members

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.177
too scared to speak on air.

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:44.978
An exclusive

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.212
CNN investigation

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.782
has found the story of 13 year old

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.084
Anna now Manko or Anna, as she's known,

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:52.786
who was brought specially

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.754
from her foster family in Mariupol

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.923
for the event in Moscow.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:01:00.093
And behind the propaganda on his own

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.227
bewildered view

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:04.097
posted to her social media

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:05.398
reaches, what could he do?

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.366
Look at all the rows,

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.000
she says,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.135
before being told where she will stand

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.703
and what she will say

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:16.376
It was a

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:17.043
year ago that

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:19.779
Anna's hometown of Mariupol was pounded.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.449
Devastating, heavy artillery

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:25.051
forcing its population underground

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.387
to basements like this one,

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:27.987
a refuge

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.756
shared for much of the three month

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.191
long siege by Anna.

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.158
Her family

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.626
and Katrina postive it

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.061
who is now in Germany.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:35.528
She couldn't

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.496
believe her eyes

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.332
when she saw her on stage.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.468
We were like a family.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:44.070
We saved ourselves, saved our lives.

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.240
But in early April on, his mother, Olga,

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.541
left the basement

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.643
and was killed by Russian shelling,

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.512
by

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.514
honest grief for her mother,

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.416
like so much else, innocent

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.884
he shared online.

00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:00.620
I want to be with you, she writes.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.988
By the end of the siege, Ana

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:03.523
and her siblings were separated

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:04.824
by their mother's death.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.727
Anya sent to a foster family in Mariupol.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.262
Karim Khan,

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.363
the head of the International

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:11.431
Criminal Court,

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:13.399
believes that through its propaganda,

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:15.902
Moscow risks incriminating itself

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.570
regarding Anna.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.606
It's very troubling and

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.109
the Rome Statute,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.478
and, in fact, the Geneva Conventions

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:28.181
make it clear regarding how children

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:30.049
must be

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:32.285
treated by occupying powers.

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:35.955
The law is present to many think

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:38.491
it's an optional extra

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.494
CNN has reached out to Russian officials

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:42.662
for comment on the children

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.697
featured in Putin's rally last week.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:47.433
Moscow has not responded.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:49.202
But for all the tragedy of Anna's

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:49.736
short life

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.403
so far,

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:52.172
the propaganda event has brought her

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:55.341
fresh troubles, the daily

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:55.975
and violent

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.111
threats under her adolescent posts.

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:00.013
Anya, don't be shy.

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:01.848
When we celebrate Mariupol again,

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:04.250
you'll be hanging from a post down town,

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.352
just one of the threats made,

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:07.554
but a reflection of

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:08.922
so much more of the abuse

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:11.324
young Anna has received.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:12.725
She's not just concerned.

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.494
We need to stay human.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:15.395
She is a child

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:17.297
who survived the war, famine,

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.431
and lost her mother

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:21.868
She's small.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.803
Even if she looks like an adult,

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:27.106
she is a child of

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:29.509
but children,

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:30.210
as symbols

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.010
of the future

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.445
play an important part

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.180
in Orwellian displays of loyalty

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.181
to Moscow,

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.549
like this one held in occupied

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.451
Mariupol last week.

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:40.119
Two visions of childhood.

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:42.722
One carefree, the other twisted.

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:44.324
Melissa Bell, CNN.

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:46.226
He will get some perspective now

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.193
from the chief prosecutor

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:48.528
at the International Criminal Court.

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:49.095
You just saw there

00:03:49.095 --> 00:03:50.129
and Melissa Bell's report.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.631
Karim Khan has more than 25

00:03:51.631 --> 00:03:52.498
years experience

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:53.666
as international criminal

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:56.603
law and human rights attorney.

00:03:56.936 --> 00:03:58.972
Mr.
Khan, you are in Ukraine.

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:02.108
Last time we spoke together in Lviv

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:04.177
about a year ago.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.778
Can you talk about what you're doing

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:06.512
on the ground

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:10.383
there now, what your focus is

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:12.151
Well, as we said

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.753
when we last spoke, Anderson,

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:15.288
that Ukraine is a crime scene.

00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:15.888
We've been looking

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:18.491
at a variety of locations

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:21.227
from a care homes on the front lines

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:22.228
of Ukraine

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:23.363
that were occupied

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:25.098
by the Russian Federation

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.366
to power stations

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:27.600
that were targeted

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.702
to residential buildings

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:31.504
that have been partly destroyed,

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:33.706
trying to find out what took place,

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:34.307
what crimes,

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:35.408
if any, have been committed

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:36.676
and who's responsible.

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:39.445
We showed just some video there of you

00:04:39.679 --> 00:04:40.813
I think you called a care home.

00:04:40.813 --> 00:04:41.247
I think it's

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:42.181
like an orphanage

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:43.116
in southern

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:45.151
southern Ukraine near the front lines.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:46.953
What were you looking at there

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:47.920
or what were you looking

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:49.922
for?

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:53.359
Well, we've seen from many sources

00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:55.862
a number of allegations that children

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.665
have been taken from Ukraine

00:04:59.098 --> 00:05:02.502
and forcibly transferred to be deported

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:04.370
into the Russian Federation.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.507
And this was one of the homes concerned.

00:05:07.507 --> 00:05:09.108
It's a beautiful site.

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:11.511
In fact, you see empty cots,

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:14.580
children's shoes and clothing

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:18.217
often donated by well-wishers.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.787
In in cupboards and on shelves

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:22.055
and on the walls.

00:05:22.055 --> 00:05:22.722
You say

00:05:22.722 --> 00:05:24.023
paintings of children

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:24.857
that we see in our own

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:26.592
homes, in bedrooms

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:27.960
around the world of children

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.363
that are proud to display the art

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:32.031
and then photographs

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:33.266
of really Christmas past.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.735
Sometimes children dressed up

00:05:35.735 --> 00:05:37.904
in nativity plays

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:40.039
and that's in very sharp contrast,

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:45.111
the joy, the environment to the silence

00:05:45.478 --> 00:05:48.114
of what is otherwise now a empty carcass

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:49.315
of a building

00:05:49.315 --> 00:05:52.485
with the toys and the playthings

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:54.454
of children.

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:55.621
But no children at all

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:56.823
because the allegation is

00:05:56.823 --> 00:05:57.623
they've been taken

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:00.960
into the Russian Federation

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.061
away from their

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.262
families and loved ones

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:05.865
and the familiar environment

00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:07.600
that they'd grown up in.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.436
So that that's what you believe

00:06:10.703 --> 00:06:11.237
may have happened

00:06:11.237 --> 00:06:12.271
to the kids at the place

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:13.139
you were today, that

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:14.907
they've actually been taken into Russia

00:06:14.907 --> 00:06:16.275
or somewhere

00:06:16.709 --> 00:06:18.378
Well, this is the allegations

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:19.278
that we're looking into.

00:06:19.278 --> 00:06:21.047
We've had it from multiple sources

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:23.282
that there may be a

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.852
pattern of conduct that children

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:26.986
from the areas

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:30.690
occupied by Russian Federation forces

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.093
have been taken into the territory

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:35.194
of the Russian Federation,

00:06:35.194 --> 00:06:37.063
not given to neutral third countries,

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:38.131
not given

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:38.731
or sent

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:39.932
to other parts of Ukraine,

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:42.502
but taken into the Russian Federation.

00:06:42.502 --> 00:06:44.103
So we have been

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:45.138
investigating this,

00:06:45.138 --> 00:06:47.573
and I went to the front line

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:48.508
yesterday, in fact,

00:06:48.508 --> 00:06:50.476
and went to one of these homes,

00:06:50.476 --> 00:06:52.412
and I wanted to see it for myself.

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.546
You also, I understand, met

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:54.680
with President Zelensky

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.015
also I believe Attorney

00:06:56.015 --> 00:06:57.083
General Merrick Garland,

00:06:57.083 --> 00:06:58.885
who made a surprise trip there.

00:06:58.885 --> 00:06:59.585
Can you talk at all

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:02.221
about what that was like, what

00:07:02.789 --> 00:07:04.056
the focus of the meeting was

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:08.494
Yes.
Well, it's now public.

00:07:08.494 --> 00:07:10.263
I mean, live at the moment

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:11.597
and presence Alinsky

00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:12.999
and the government of Ukraine

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:14.500
hosted a conference

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.103
a really historic conference, in fact,

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:19.272
in the middle of a war

00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:22.809
called entitled United for Justice.

00:07:23.309 --> 00:07:24.510
And it was really to focus

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.846
on the importance of the rule of law,

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:28.347
even as bullets are flying

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:29.282
and bombs are landing

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:31.784
and wreaking tremendous havoc.

00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:34.053
And Attorney General Garland was

00:07:35.054 --> 00:07:35.955
attended as well.

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:38.958
And the United States is supporting

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:41.761
Ukraine in terms of the rule of law.

00:07:41.961 --> 00:07:42.361
And also,

00:07:42.361 --> 00:07:43.696
I had the opportunity

00:07:43.696 --> 00:07:44.564
of meeting

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:46.599
the attorney general for the first time,

00:07:46.599 --> 00:07:47.433
and I'm looking forward

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:49.001
to see whether or not we can also get

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:50.770
some tangible assistance

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:51.938
from the United States,

00:07:51.938 --> 00:07:53.105
because since December,

00:07:53.105 --> 00:07:54.507
the law has changed

00:07:54.507 --> 00:07:56.576
that the United States can support

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:58.311
the International Criminal Court

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.011
in relation

00:07:59.011 --> 00:08:00.213
to the investigations

00:08:00.213 --> 00:08:01.814
we're conducting in Bahrain.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:02.815
So we can get to the truth

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:05.084
and I want to see whether or not that

00:08:05.585 --> 00:08:06.919
promise of assistance

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:09.088
can be rendered tangible

00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:10.323
as soon as possible.

00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:10.790
I mean, you've had

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.458
an extraordinary career

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:13.759
looking at war

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:14.894
crimes and

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:16.128
crimes against humanity,

00:08:16.128 --> 00:08:17.763
international crimes.

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:20.466
It's very rare, though, and

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:21.400
you and I have talked about this

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:21.901
in the past.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:22.535
It's very rare

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:24.437
to have an active investigations

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:27.240
like this going on in the midst of a war.

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:29.942
I mean, often it's years after a war

00:08:29.942 --> 00:08:33.513
has ended, decades even

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:34.247
Absolutely.

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:35.248
And I think

00:08:35.414 --> 00:08:36.582
even today's conference

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:38.851
was absolutely historic

00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:41.521
because we had the London agreement

00:08:41.621 --> 00:08:43.990
in August 1945

00:08:44.457 --> 00:08:47.159
that discussed the importance of trials

00:08:47.793 --> 00:08:48.661
that would come at the end

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.062
of the Second World War

00:08:50.062 --> 00:08:51.931
and gave rise to Nuremberg

00:08:51.931 --> 00:08:53.599
But here we are.

00:08:53.599 --> 00:08:55.101
Yesterday, I was on the front line

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:57.136
and there were drones in the sky.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:58.771
There were shells landing

00:08:58.771 --> 00:09:00.072
in different parts of Ukraine.

00:09:00.072 --> 00:09:00.573
And

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.943
I think it is to the tremendous credit

00:09:04.477 --> 00:09:06.445
of the Ukrainian authorities

00:09:06.445 --> 00:09:07.113
that they are talking

00:09:07.113 --> 00:09:07.947
about the rule of law

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:09.248
and what we need to do

00:09:09.248 --> 00:09:10.783
as the International Criminal Court

00:09:10.783 --> 00:09:11.484
is to make sure

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:13.386
that our own investigations

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:14.654
are independent,

00:09:14.654 --> 00:09:16.689
credible and are based upon

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:17.924
evidence that will stand the

00:09:17.924 --> 00:09:19.191
test of time. And I think

00:09:21.127 --> 00:09:22.728
it does a lot of firsts in

00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:24.864
this conflict, Anderson,

00:09:24.864 --> 00:09:25.498
for good and bad.

